  "mteb_contract_version": "1.38.60",
  "findings": [
    "TokenizerWrapper uses one terminal EOS, then unmasked token-ID-0 left padding to the batch maximum, then last-2048 truncation.",
    "CrossEncoderWrapper.predict defaults to 32; the inspected MTEB evaluator chunks at 128 but invokes predict without forwarding batch_size, so this wrapper internally pads in groups of 32.",
    "The checked-in smallest text-only training example selects ctx_len=2048 and the dataset left-pads to ctx_len. This is source evidence, not proof of the exact training run used for released weights.",
    "No padding mask reaches the released RWKV forward_seq_batch; token 0 enters embedding, token mixing and recurrence."
